          "tab_title": "What's the difference between cPanel, semi-managed and reseller hosting?",
          "tab_content": "<p>cPanel gives you full control and you manage everything yourself. Semi-managed means we handle the setup, updates and troubleshooting so you don’t have to. Reseller hosting is for anyone managing sites for clients, with your own branding and full account control.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "77ede16",
          "tab_title": "Can you migrate my existing website across?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Yes, for free. We migrate your files, databases and email, and most sites move across with no downtime.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "ee0e471",
          "tab_title": "How much storage do I get?",
          "tab_content": "<p>It depends on the plan: 5GB to 30GB of high-speed SSD storage on cPanel and semi-managed WordPress plans, and 25GB to 75GB on reseller plans. You can switch plans any time as you grow.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "c1a45d9",
          "tab_title": "Is a domain included with hosting?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Domains are registered separately. <a href=\"/domains/\">Search for your domain</a>, and we'll connect it to your hosting for you.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "a522ab5",
          "tab_title": "What happens if my site goes down?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Our servers are monitored around the clock from right here in Perth, so we're usually already on it. If you need us, call a real Perth number, <a href=\"tel:+61863654522\">08 6365 4522</a>, and talk to someone who can fix it.</p>"
